    <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:14px;">RFID &amp; Smart Tags · RFID Inlays</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">RFID inlays</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Hana manufactures dry and wet RFID inlays at volume using reel-to-reel processes. RFID die are attached to printed or etched antennas on a flexible web, then encoded, read-verified and supplied on reel for downstream conversion into labels, tickets and tags.</p>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:407px;"><img src="/images/photos/mk-rfid-card-inlays.webp" alt="RFID inlay web on a converting reel" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;" /></div>
